    artifact: "B\u1EA3ng nh\xE3n gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh k\xE8m ph\xE9p \u0111\u1ED5i \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB v\xE0 c\xE2u h\u1ECFi chuy\xEAn m\xF4n; kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i danh s\xE1ch s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m n\xEAn mua.",
