    modelResponse: ["M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u1EE7a ca l\xE0 hi\u1EC3u k\u1EBF ho\u1EA1ch, kh\xF4ng \xE9p m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EA3m c\xE2n. C\xE2n t\u1ED5ng kh\xF4ng ch\u1EE9ng minh m\xF4 m\u1EE1 thay \u0111\u1ED5i.", "M\xF4 h\xECnh trung t\xE2m thi\u1EBFu h\u1EE5t 300 kcal/ng\xE0y nh\u01B0ng t\u1ED5 h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC1 cho l\xE0 0\u2013600; kh\xF4ng xem \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 kho\u1EA3ng tin c\u1EADy hay t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9.", "T\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c b\u1EEFa neo v\xE0 ng\xE0y b\u1EADn, r\xE0 tr\u1EA3i nghi\u1EC7m c\xF9ng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u. N\u1EBFu c\xF3 cho\xE1ng ho\u1EB7c h\xE0nh vi \u0103n u\u1ED1ng c\xF3 h\u1EA1i, \u01B0u ti\xEAn h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng ch\u1EDD ng\xE0y r\xE0 hay c\u1EAFt th\xEAm."],
