      given: ["C\xE2n A = c\xE2n B = 70 kg.", "M\xF4 h\xECnh hai ng\u0103n, ph\u1EA7n tr\u0103m l\xE0 \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE0o gi\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ECBnh.", "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ph\xE9p \u0111o ri\xEAng m\xF4 c\u01A1."],
