      takeaways: ["H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 h\u1EADu c\u1EA7n b\u1EEFa \u0103n kh\xF4ng thay \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 y khoa.", "Kh\xF4ng g\u1ED9p sau sinh v\xE0 cho con b\xFA th\xE0nh c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t c\xF4ng th\u1EE9c calorie."],
